  <div class="pod-copy">
    <p>{{ t('The most interesting quadrant is: <strong>long yields rising while the dollar falls.</strong> That combination says investors are demanding more compensation to hold the duration while simultaneously becoming less enthusiastic about the currency exposure. It does not prove a fiscal crisis. But it is the market signature that deserves the most attention if the sovereign-duration problem is deepening.',
      '最值得关注的象限是：<strong>长期收益率上升，而美元下跌。</strong>这组组合意味着，投资者一边要求更多补偿才愿意持有久期，一边却对货币敞口降低热情。它并不能证明财政危机，但如果主权久期问题正在加深，这正是最值得关注的市场签名。') }}</p>
    <p>{{ t('This is why the present gold move matters more than its headline price alone. Gold is strengthening before the Federal Reserve has delivered the clean easing cycle we once expected to be necessary. That suggests the market is not simply pricing lower future policy rates. It is beginning to price uncertainty over <strong>how the duration problem will ultimately be resolved</strong>.',
      '这正是当前黄金走势的意义超过其标题价格的原因。黄金在美联储尚未兑现我们曾认为必要的干净宽松周期之前就已走强。这表明市场并非只是在定价未来更低的政策利率，而是开始为<strong>久期问题最终将如何被解决</strong>的不确定性定价。') }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pod-callout" style="--pod-c:var(--pod-red)">
