    <figcaption>{{ t('The gross stablecoin market cap is not the same as incremental Treasury demand. Source of funds matters. Even when bill demand is genuinely new, the benefit is indirect: more short-end capacity can reduce marginal long-end pressure while increasing refinancing sensitivity. [F/I]',
