  <h2 id="falsifiers"><span class="num">13</span>{{ t('What would prove this report wrong', '什么会证明本报告错了') }}</h2>
  <div class="pod-copy l-en">
    <p>A serious research report should make its own invalidation conditions obvious.</p>
    <p>The central thesis would weaken materially if the market solved the duration problem without increasingly active policy engineering.</p>
    <p>The clean falsification would look like this: long Treasury yields fall sustainably; private and foreign auction demand improves; AI corporate issuance remains easily absorbed; credit spreads stay tight; core inflation trends cleanly lower; energy pressure fades; the dollar remains stable; and Treasury does not need to keep expanding duration-management tools.</p>
    <p>That would mean the current episode was primarily a temporary mix of positioning, liquidity and inflation uncertainty. The market found a natural clearing price. The sovereign-duration story would deserve less weight. Gold's fiscal-confidence premium would deserve to compress. Benign Absorption would become the dominant regime.</p>
    <p>The opposite constellation would make the thesis much more urgent.</p>
    <p>If: long yields move materially higher and stay there; real yields remain extremely restrictive; the dollar weakens anyway; credit spreads widen; VIX becomes persistent; Treasury auction demand worsens; AI financing becomes visibly more expensive; and breadth deteriorates—then the market is no longer merely asking for a higher price to hold duration. It is beginning to question the mechanism through which that duration will ultimately be absorbed.</p>
    <p>That is the point where the fiscal/monetary endgame becomes less theoretical.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pod-copy l-zh">
    <p>严肃的研究报告应让自身的失效条件一目了然。若市场无需日益积极的政策工程就解决久期问题，中心论点将实质走弱。</p>
    <p>干净证伪应是：长期美债收益率持续下降；私人与海外拍卖需求改善；AI 企业发债仍轻松被吸收；信用利差紧；核心通胀清晰趋降；能源压力消退；美元稳定；财政部不必继续扩大久期管理工具。</p>
    <p>这将说明当前事件主要是仓位、流动性与通胀不确定的暂时组合，市场找到了自然出清价；主权久期故事应降权，黄金的财政信心溢价应收缩，良性吸收将成为主导体制。</p>
    <p>相反的组合会让论点更紧迫：长端收益率实质上升并居高不下；实际收益率仍极具限制性；美元却走弱；信用利差走阔；VIX 持续；美债拍卖需求恶化；AI 融资明显更贵；市场广度恶化。此时市场已不只是要求更高久期持有价格，而在质疑这些久期最终通过什么机制被吸收。到那一点，财政/货币终局就不再那么理论化。</p>
  </div>

