  <h2 id="market-changed"><span class="num">1</span>{{ t('The market just told us something changed', '市场刚刚告诉我们：有些东西变了') }}</h2>
  <div class="pod-section-kicker">{{ t('Opening diagnosis · anomaly before narrative', '开篇诊断 · 先看异常，再讲叙事') }}</div>
  <div class="pod-copy">
    <p>{{ t('There are moments when markets stop behaving according to the story investors have been using to explain them. Those moments matter because the anomaly is usually more informative than the trend. <strong>This is one of those moments.</strong>',
      '有些时刻，市场会突然不再按照投资者惯用的故事运行。这种时刻很重要，因为异常通常比趋势本身更有信息量。<strong>现在正是这样的时刻。</strong>') }}</p>
    <p>{{ t('Gold has broken sharply higher even though long-term interest rates remain restrictive. Bitcoin has moved before the conventional easing cycle we once thought it would need. The dollar has weakened from its hawkish-squeeze highs. At the same time, <strong>VIX and broad high-yield credit still look far calmer than a genuine financial accident should look.</strong>',
      '尽管长期利率仍具约束性，黄金却已大幅突破；比特币也在我们过去认为它必须等待的传统宽松周期之前启动；美元则从鹰派挤压的高点回落。与此同时，<strong>VIX 与广义高收益债信用的平静程度，远高于真正金融事故应有的样子。</strong>') }}</p>
    <p>{{ t('The missing piece is the <strong>price of duration</strong>. The United States is trying to finance two enormous projects at the same time: the federal government itself and the physical AI buildout. Both ultimately arrive at the same market. Both need investors willing to lock money away for years.',
      '缺失的拼图是<strong>久期的价格</strong>。美国正在同时为两个庞大项目融资：联邦政府自身，以及实体化的 AI 建设。两者最终都来到同一个市场，也都需要投资者愿意把资金锁定多年。') }}</p>
    <p>{{ t('When the amount of long-term capital demanded rises faster than the amount investors willingly supply at yesterday&rsquo;s price, <strong>the yield has to rise until the market balances.</strong> The present combination says the cost of capital is uncomfortable, but the system is still absorbing it. This is a selection regime, not a declaration that the system has broken.',
      '当长期资本需求的增速快于投资者愿意按昨日价格提供的资金，<strong>收益率就必须上升，直到市场重新平衡。</strong>当前组合说明资本成本已经令人不适，但系统仍在吸收它。这是一个筛选体制，并不是宣布系统已经崩坏。') }}</p>
  </div>
  <h3>{{ t('The anomaly that matters', '真正重要的异常') }}</h3>
  <div class="pod-shell-rail" aria-label="Anomaly signals">
    <span class="chip">{{ t('Long yields high', '长端收益率高企') }}</span>
