  <div class="pod-callout" style="--pod-c:var(--pod-red)">
    <b>{{ t('Reader takeaway', '读者要点') }}</b>
    <p>{{ t('No single yield threshold proves fiscal stress. The most important warning is <strong>long yields rising while the dollar falls</strong>—the market demanding more compensation for the duration while simultaneously becoming less enthusiastic about the currency denomination. [I]',
      '没有任何单一收益率阈值能够证明财政压力。最重要的警告是<strong>长端收益率上升而美元下跌</strong>——市场一边要求更高的久期补偿，一边降低对该计价货币的热情。[I]') }}</p>
