  <div data-figure-slot="fig-reactions"></div>
  <div class="callout warn">
    <span class="co-h">{{ t('Boundary conditions', '边界条件') }}</span>
    {{ t('<strong>Treasury buybacks are not QE.</strong> There is no official Treasury yield cap. Buybacks can support market functioning and alter the market&rsquo;s reaction function, but Treasury still has to finance itself elsewhere. Current conditions are a warning about the price of capital, not a credit crisis.',
      '<strong>财政部回购不是量化宽松。</strong>财政部并未设定官方收益率上限。回购可以改善市场运行并改变市场的反应函数，但财政部仍需在别处完成融资。当前状况是资本价格发出的警告，不是信用危机。') }}
  </div>

  <h2 id="stablecoin-machine-v2"><span class="num">5</span>{{ t('Stablecoins and the Treasury bill machine', '稳定币与国库券机器') }}</h2>
  <div class="pod-section-kicker">{{ t('Collateral architecture · a maturity trade, not free money', '抵押品架构 · 到期结构交易，而非免费资金') }}</div>
  <p>{{ t('Regulated dollar stablecoins can become a distribution system for dollar liabilities backed by cash, repo and short-dated Treasury securities. The critical word is <strong>short-dated</strong>: rapid redemption makes long-bond price volatility a poor reserve match.',
    '受监管的美元稳定币可以成为一种美元负债分销系统，由现金、回购与短期美国国债支持。关键在于<strong>短期</strong>：快速赎回使长债价格波动无法成为合适的储备匹配。') }}</p>
  <div data-figure-slot="fig-stablecoin"></div>
  <div class="pod-table-wrap"><table class="pod-table pod-compact">
    <thead><tr><th>{{ t('Stablecoins can potentially...', '稳定币可能做到……') }}</th><th>{{ t('They cannot directly...', '它们不能直接做到……') }}</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>{{ t('Create structural demand for bills', '创造对国库券的结构性需求') }}</td><td><strong>{{ t('Create natural demand for 30Y Treasuries', '创造对 30 年期美债的自然需求') }}</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t('Expand global dollar distribution', '扩大美元全球分销') }}</td><td>{{ t('Eliminate fiscal deficits', '消除财政赤字') }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t('Increase short-end financing capacity', '提高短端融资能力') }}</td><td>{{ t('Remove refinancing risk', '消除再融资风险') }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{ t('Deepen Treasury-backed digital settlement', '深化以美债支持的数字结算') }}</td><td>{{ t('Make Bitcoin &ldquo;backed by Treasuries&rdquo;', '让比特币“获得美债支持”') }}</td></tr>
    </tbody>
