  <p>{{ t('<strong>Stablecoin bill demand is not equivalent to 30-year Treasury demand.</strong> The structure can trade long-duration market risk for greater sensitivity to short policy rates. Bitcoin remains outside the reserve loop: <strong>Bitcoin is not backed by Treasury or stablecoin reserves.</strong>',
